# Data licence

This file covers the **dataset**: `data/**` and the generated tables in
`games/**`.

Source code, configuration, scripts and documentation are covered separately by
the MIT licence in [LICENSE](./LICENSE). The split exists because code and data
are different kinds of work with different constraints — MIT is a software
licence and says nothing useful about a compilation of facts.

